    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## JobBots n8n / synchronous FastAPI\n- No date or JSON body in any POST. FastAPI uses Windows local date.\n- **FastAPI startup**: `python -m uvicorn linkedin.linkedin_fastapi:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000` (ensure n8n can reach it).\n- **Required Chrome**: debugger active on port 9222, logged into LinkedIn and ChatGPT.\n- Two ChatGPT submission calls **do not** wait for remote ZIP generation. Wait and downloader retries bridge the gap.\n- Defaults to **no emails**. To enable reviewed outreach, set `Workflow Options/send_emails=true` and `JOBBOTS_ALLOW_OUTREACH=1` in FastAPI environment.\n- HTTP request timeouts are deliberately long for synchronous tasks. If you are using reverse proxies, check their idle timeout.\n- If FastAPI requires `X-API-Key`, configure that header on all protected HTTP nodes.\n- Scraper and all steps recompute today in Windows. Run during the same local day (12:30 IST schedule).",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 1000,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "de4d07cd-7144-4205-8f35-9106bf810479",
      "name": "IMPORTANT - READ BEFORE ENABLING",
